<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id">Nahum</book>
  <para style="h">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahum</para>
  <para style="mt">Nahum</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam pen Nineveh tawh kisai thuphuon hi a, Elkosh khuomi Nahum’ mangmuna laibu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa pen a thangsie le phulah hat Pasien ahi a, Topa in phula a, a lungthah mama hi; ama a langpangte tungah Topa in phu la a, a galte tungah ama a thangpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa lungthah bai loin, ahi vangin vanglien mama a, tuale Topa in a khielte dan pieh loin mawh hla lo ding hi. A lampi pen pingpei lah le huipi lah ahi a, meiilumte pen a ketot leivui ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in tuipi hosie-in kanggawsah a, gun zosie a kanggawsah hi; Bashan le Carmel muolte gawta a, Lebanon paape vulnang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama mai-ah muolte kiling a, muoltangte a tuisuoh hi; ama mai-ah leitang, leitung le a sunga a teng zosie a kilawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thangpaina mai-ah koi ding zo ding ahei? A lungthahna koi in thuoh zo ding ahei? Meikuong bangin a thangpaina kisung a, ama ziehin suongpite a pawhkeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa hoi a, lungkham hunin kibuhna mun muonhuoi ahi hi; ama sunga a kibu mite ama in a humbih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuikhang sung nangawnah a langte mangthaisah ding a, khuomiel lahah a galte a delmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bang dinga Topa na do sawm ahei? Ama in maimangsah ding a, a langte koima nivei dingkia zo lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate ling bangin kikanbawmin, lenggazu khamte bangin a om vua, butu gawta bangin a katum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang kung panin Topa a langpan dingin, thusie bawl sawm mi khat pusuoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi, “Amate bangci hatin hatin tam zong nan ule, amate kisusie-in a mangthai veve ding uhi. Keima in kang bawlsiet ngai vangin, kang bawlsie nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in na tung panin ama’ hahkol ka hliehtawng ding a, ang kikhina khaute ka botsan ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in nang tawh kisai thupie zo hi: “Na min kizom suoh nawn lo ding hi; na pasien-te’ inn panin a bawltawm milim le a kisung milim ka sumaimang ding hi. Kimanna nei lo na hi ziehin na hankhuh ka bawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Muolte tungah lungdamna thu a puoh, kilemna a phuongzah mipa’ keng en un! Judah aw, na pawite bawl inlen, na kiciemnate uh tangtungsah in, azieh pen migilote in ang sim ngai nawn sih ding hi; amate kisumaimang zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang ang sim dingin a susie ding pa khat ang kuonto zo ta hi. Na kul cing inlen, lampi zong vil in; a kawng gah inlen, na tha nei zosie san in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Azieh pen a susie mite in amate susie-in amau’ baate a suhsiet vangun, Topa in Israel’ thupina bangin Jacob’ thupina zong a ngai bangsahkia ding hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A galhangte’ lumte khu a san ahi hi; a galkapte in puonsan a sil uhi, Gal sim dingin amate a kiguolsah ni-in sakol leengte tunga siate te lihleh hi; gal sakolte in gal sim ding ngahla-in a keng uh a sai vapial uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gawldung cin tengah sakol leengte a mot tai vua, tuol-awng tengah amate suhtai totai kawikawi uhi; a melpuoh uh meisel kuong tawh kibang a, tunphe bangin a phe leplep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a uliente hlan hi; mailamah a pei ciengun kipalpua uhi; kulpi a kidenna vua, a lum utawh a kidal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gun tunkotte kihong a, kumpi innpi kiling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sala pei dingin khuopi thukip kipie a, a sila numeite kikaimangin, vahui bangin mau-in a awm a beng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nineveh khuopi pen a tuite a kang sieng buol tawh kibang hi. “Khawl un! Khawl un!” a kici vangin koima kinuahei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngunte lahpieh unlen, khamte lahpieh un! A goute un tawp hun nei lo hi! Van manpha cinteng tam valuh sam e!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Suhsietna, hawmsuona, le kisietna! Lung tawpin khupte tun a, kawng zosie kilingin, maitang zosie a muolmang hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Koima in nawngkaisah loin, humpite le humpi note a va kawikawina mun khu hei sungah om a, humpite kuo le humpi khanglaite’ leihawm bang suoh a ta ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Humpi in a note adingin a khamkhop ding uh sa ehmal a, humpi anute adingin a samat a lawlmeh pieh hi; leihawm sungah sa dimsah a, a ki-ehmal satelte tawh a kuo sung kidimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En in, nang kang langpang hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi. Keima in na sakol leengte haltumin meikhu kitung ding a, namsau tawh na humpi khanglaite ka vatmai ding hi; leitung panin na kiva nading sate ka sumaimang ding a, tuale na kamtaite’ awging kiza ngai nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sisan luonna khuopi, zuouna le van lahpiehna tawh a kidim, misuomte a ven lona khuopi aw! gimna na thuoh ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sakol kisat ging le lengkang kigawt ging, sakol koptaite ketot ging le sakol leeng kitomte ging khu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sakol galkapte in a phe valeh namsau le a tee lihleh teipite tawh gal a do vua, a kiseng misi lomtang teng, tuolluong lum misi teng, misi luongte a tawp thei sih a, siluongte tungah a kipai uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tamte zosie simzawh lo, numei pahtat nu’ a thanghuoi gamtatna zieha pieng hi a, ama etlawmin ngaibang a, mibum siemnu zong ahi a, mi thangtatnate’ tungtawn le a mi bumna tungtawnin ama in minamte salin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang kang langpan hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi, na maitangah na nih ka lemto ding hi; tua hile minamte in guohtanga na opna le kumpi gamte in na zumhuoina kang ensah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kidahhuoi buathah tawh kang sep ding a, hing simmaw bawlin, mite’ et dingin kang bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin ang mu zosie nuakinin, “Nineveh khuopi kisie ta hi; koi in ama a kaa ta ding ahei? Ang henem ding mi hei-ah sui ding ka hei?” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nile gun gei-ah om a, tui in a kimkot, a leicien tuipi le a kulpi tui ahi, Thebes sangin nang a thupizaw na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia le Egypt zong ciengtan nei lo ama’ thahatna ahi hi; Put mite le Libya mite pen ama a panpite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanle ama gambel a suoh a, saltang dingin a pei hi; gawlzin bul cintengah a tasente nangawn a ki-ehmal hi; a miliente adingin ai kisan a, a mithupi zosie siakol kibul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang zong zu khamin a kiphuol dingin na pei ding a, galte kung panin kibuhna na sui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kulpite zosie a ga a min masa pen theikung bang ding a, a kithin leh a ne ding pa’ kam sungah tuate a kiesuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na galkapte en in: Na mai-ah amate numei ahi uhi. Na galte adingin na gam tunkotte a kigol hon mama hi; na tunkotgolh zawlte mei in a katum ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ei ki-im hun sung teng adingin tui tawi-in na kulpite detsah in; tehlei khen nadingin buon pawi inlen, tehlei kisehna kuong a baisa-in koi in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khum munah mei in hing katumin, namsau in nang ang bansan ding hi. tua in kauphe bangin ang netum ding hi. Kauphe bangin na khang a, khuombai bangin na pung hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na sumbuhte vana aasi sanga a tamzaw dingin na khangsah hi. Kauphe in a vun khelin a lengmang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang ang cingte ahile, khuombai tawh a kibang vua, na laitheite, khuodam ni-a daithaw tunga a tu, nisuo cienga a lengmang kauphe hon tawh kibang uhi; amau’ tunna le banna mun koima in thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Assyria kumpipa aw, na tuucingte a kimu uhi; na mi thupite a lusu uhi. Muol tungah na mite a kithezah vua, a khawmtuo ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na liemna a nuom tuomsah ding mi a om sih a, na hima pen a dam thei lo nam ahi hi. Na thu a za mi zosie in a khut a beng ding uhi. Azieh pen a tawp thei lo na gitlona panin koi suohta ngai ahei?
  </para>
</usx>
